DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Health Promotion\n\nThis event will spotlight the V
 eggie Meter. A device that measures the amount of carotenoids in a person'
 s in a person's skin to estimate their consumption of fruits and vegetable
 s. The machine generates a "score" by using reflection spectroscopy to mea
 sure carotenoid pigments by scanning the tip of the finger.&nbsp\; It take
 s less than a minute to do.
LOCATION:Wellness House
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12382234
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
END:VEVENT
