DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Quantitative Finance Society\n\nAn event hosted by 
 the Quantitative Finance Society in partnership with Jane Street. Particip
 ants will engage in a variety of challenging estimation questions to test 
 their quantitative and qualitative approximation skills. From JS- &ldquo\;
 The Estimathon is a team-based contest that combines trivia\, game theory\
 , and mathematical thinking. Teams have 30 minutes to work on a set of 13 
 estimation problems\, the winning team being the one with the best set of 
 estimates.&rdquo\;
