 o empower students to transform unused clothing into bold\, personalized s
 treetwear while fostering creativity\, sustainability\, and self-expressio
 n. The event is a hands-on design experience where members take an old or 
 unused t-shirt and turn it into a custom\, wearable statement piece. Inspi
 red by streetwear culture and DIY fashion\, this event gives students acce
 ss to stencils\, airbrush tools\, bleach dye techniques\, and fabric marke
 rs to completely reimagine their clothing. Whether members prefer minimal 
