BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bradford Woods Open Gate Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260509T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260509T140000
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12433818
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/fd
 1973cb-97e0-4fef-af11-2c88da33eaa4571a2d35-6a28-4685-9393-b0d20ebf2424.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Bradford Woods\n\nCome explore Bradford Woods durin
 g our Open Gate Day on Friday\, May 9\, from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m.! Bring your
  friends and enjoy a day of hiking and discovery. Admission is just $10 pe
 r carload. Guests will also have the opportunity to purchase limited ticke
 ts for select activities on a first-come\, first-served basis\, including 
 archery ($15 per person for a 45-minute session) and the chance to climb o
 ur exciting\, 50-foot Tango Tower ($25 per person for a one-hour session).
  S&rsquo\;mores kits will also be available for roasting on-site for $3 pe
 r two-pack &mdash\; the perfect way to top off your visit!
LOCATION:Bradford Woods
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12433818
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wilderness First Aid Courses
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260509T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260510T170000
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12122726
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/3d
 e78e70-77dd-4d3a-b18e-a39aa078609deb51894f-9486-4bfa-b71e-954dccc1ec79.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Bradford Woods\n\nOur Wilderness First Aid (WFA) co
 urses will give you the skills needed to respond to medical emergencies wh
 en help is far away. This is a 2-day/16-hour course that features extensiv
 e hands-on learning opportunities. Students will walk away with a 2-year W
 FA certification from Stonehearth Open Learning Opportunities (SOLO)\, whi
 ch is one of the oldest wilderness medicine organizations in the world. St
 udents may also add on CPR modules and/or re-certify for their SOLO Wilder
 ness First Responder (WFR) certification. Courses start at $275. Cost incl
 udes course materials and lunch on Saturday and Sunday. Overnight lodging 
 from Friday&ndash\;Sunday may be available for participants on a first-com
 e\, first-serve basis. Register for the course here.
LOCATION:Bradford Woods
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12122726
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
END:VEVENT
